!!! oculus/appearance/theme.mat
!!! Theme configuration — the active style set.
!!!
!!! A theme bundles together colors, typography hints, and
!!! elevation settings into one coherent look.

book oculus.appearance.theme

read everything from oculus.appearance.color
read everything from ny.lang.core

!!! A complete theme for the desktop.

public theme begin record
    field name as text
    field background as color-value
    field surface as color-value
    field text-primary as color-value
    field text-secondary as color-value
    field accent as color-value
end record
